+ALUK+Der/nn+PALAAQ+Der/nn:alupalaaq tp ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PALLAK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:aluppallassuaq Z2aqZ ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PALLAK+Der/nn:aluppallak tup- ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PALUK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:aluppalussuaq Z2aqZ ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PALUK+Der/nn:aluppaluk Z2aqZ ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PIAQ+Der/nn+NNGUAQ+Der/nn:alorpiannguaq Z1nnguaqZmorf ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PIAQ+Der/nn:alorpiaq tp ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PILUK+Der/nn+LIK+Der/nn+RUJUK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:alupilulerujussuaq Z2aqZ ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PILUK+Der/nn+LIK+Der/nn+RUJUK+Der/nn:alupilulerujuk tup- ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PILUK+Der/nn+LIK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:alupilulissuaq Z2aqZ ;
