+ALUK+Der/nn+PILUK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:alupilussuaq Z2aqZ ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+PILUK+Der/nn:alupiluk tup- ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+RALAAQ+Der/nn+NNGUAQ+Der/nn:aloralaannguaq Z1nnguaqZmorf ;
+ALUK+Der/nn+RUJUK+Der/nn+SUAQ+Der/nn:alorujussuaq Z2aqZ ;
